OL,3,GNEWSA'Menace to society' jailed for
OL,4,Asexual assault of teenager
OL,5,
OL,6,FA persistent criminal described as a
OL,7,F"menace to society" who carried out a
OL,8,Fsexual assault on a teenage girl in
OL,9,FAberdeenshire has been jailed.
OL,11,FColin Yeats, 44, admitted carrying out
OL,12,Fthe assault in Fraserburgh last year, a
OL,13,Fmonth after being released from prison.
OL,15,FAt the High Court in Edinburgh, Lord
OL,16,FSummers said Yeats had taken advantage
OL,17,Fof the 15-year-old girl's state of
OL,18,Fintoxication.
OL,20,F"You have an atrocious criminal
OL,21,Frecord," the judge said, jailing Yeats
OL,22,Ffor two years.
